# Omarchy

Beautiful, fun & agentic Linux.

---

![span](omakase.svg)

> Oma is for omakase — the chef picks the courses, but you are always free to send anything back.

— Omarchy

---

# What's inside

- Arch Linux under the hood
- Hyprland, a tiling Wayland compositor
- Quickshell — one themed desktop shell
- Opinionated defaults, zero bloat

---

![span](agent.svg)

# Agents are first-class

- Your agent reads configs, fixes crashes, builds plugins
- Describe an app and watch it appear

---

![](themes.svg)

---

![span](keyboard.svg)

# Keyboard-first

Tiling windows, terminal-first, every action a keystroke away.

---

![span](devices.svg)

# Runs on almost anything

Vintage Macs, potato PCs, and today's latest laptops.

---

# Make it your own

> When you can vibe code whatever app comes to mind, you should be able to vibe code your operating system.

— DHH
